---
// src/pages/about/_components/AboutOriginStory.astro
import Section from '../../../components/ui/Section.astro';
---

<Section class="py-10 md:py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white border-y border-emerald-100">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Removed items-start so the track stretches fully -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.4fr] gap-12 lg:gap-24">
      <!-- Added sticky positioning and self-start -->
      <div class="max-w-xl lg:sticky lg:top-32 self-start">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-700 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6"
        >
          Founded 2021
        </div>
        <h2
          class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-emerald-950 tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight"
        >
          How We Started <br /><em class="font-serif italic text-emerald-700 font-medium"
            >and why we grew.</em
          >
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-emerald-900/80 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          Not a pitch deck. Not a market opportunity. A mission to unite authentic Quranic tradition
          with world-class, reliable technology.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div
          class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-emerald-100 p-8 lg:p-10 hover:border-emerald-200 transition-colors group"
        >
          <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-700 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-950 mb-3">The market was split.</h3>
              <p class="text-[15px] text-emerald-900/80 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                You had tech companies that didn't understand Islamic pedagogy, and traditional
                academies that didn't know how to build stable digital platforms. Because Faisal had
                one foot in both worlds, he knew exactly what a rigorous, empathetic curriculum
                should look like—and how to build the code to deliver it flawlessly.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-emerald-100 p-8 lg:p-10 hover:border-emerald-200 transition-colors group"
        >
          <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-700 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-950 mb-3">
                Word of mouth, before advertising.
              </h3>
              <p class="text-[15px] text-emerald-900/80 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                We launched in 2021, and Faisal personally enrolled our first 26 families. For the
                first few years, we didn't run ads. Quranific grew almost entirely through parents
                telling other parents. That remains the only metric we truly care about: whether a
                family trusts us enough to recommend us.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
